from (values
('126.18.c.8.A',3,'A positive action for your digital footprint is...','["sharing helpful, respectful posts", "sharing passwords", "insulting classmates", "posting rumors"]'::jsonb,0,'Positive posts build a good reputation.','original'),
('126.18.c.8.A',3,'A negative effect on a digital footprint can come from...','["sharing a study guide", "posting an embarrassing photo publicly", "helping a friend", "completing a class project"]'::jsonb,1,'Public embarrassing posts can last.','original'),
('126.18.c.8.B',3,'Revising a message after getting feedback helps make it...','["harder to read", "less polite", "clearer and more effective", "longer without purpose"]'::jsonb,2,'Feedback improves writing.','original'),
('126.18.c.8.B',3,'A formal digital message should avoid...','["proofreading", "complete sentences", "a greeting", "slang and emojis in place of full sentences"]'::jsonb,3,'Formal tone is professional.','original'),
('126.18.c.8.C',3,'A group recording a presentation online should plan...','["who will speak and which slides each person covers", "to talk at once", "to mute everyone", "nothing"]'::jsonb,0,'Planning prevents overlap.','original'),
('126.18.c.8.C',3,'When collaborating on a shared slideshow, the best practice is to...','["avoid communication", "name your slides and leave comments for teammates", "delete others'' work", "work offline"]'::jsonb,1,'Clear communication helps teamwork.','original'),
('126.18.c.9.A',3,'Modeling safe and ethical technology use means...','["ignoring rules", "helping friends cheat", "following the AUP and setting a good example for others", "hiding behavior"]'::jsonb,2,'Role modeling supports a safe community.','original'),
('126.18.c.9.A',3,'Under most AUPs, using school devices for the following is allowed:','["hacking accounts", "bypassing filters", "sharing inappropriate files", "completing assignments"]'::jsonb,3,'AUPs support educational use.','original'),
('126.18.c.9.B',3,'Intellectual property laws benefit creators by...','["protecting their work and allowing them to earn money from it", "making work free for all", "banning art", "removing credit"]'::jsonb,0,'Laws protect creators'' rights.','original'),
('126.18.c.9.B',3,'A patent protects...','["a person''s name", "an invention", "a song", "a website color"]'::jsonb,1,'Patents cover inventions.','original'),
('126.18.c.9.C',3,'Citing an image from a website requires including...','["a random number", "only the file size", "the creator or source and where it was found", "nothing"]'::jsonb,2,'Credit and location matter.','original'),
('126.18.c.9.C',3,'A bibliography is...','["a spelling tool", "a type of font", "a file format", "a list of sources used in a project"]'::jsonb,3,'It documents research.','original'),
('126.18.c.9.D',3,'Social media can spread misleading information quickly because...','["posts can be shared widely before being checked", "there are no users", "every post is verified", "platforms reject all errors"]'::jsonb,0,'Speed can outrun fact-checking.','original'),
('126.18.c.9.D',3,'A technique that can alter photos to mislead viewers is...','["alphabetizing", "image editing or deepfake software", "defragmenting", "spell-checking"]'::jsonb,1,'Editing can distort reality.','original'),
('126.18.c.10.A',3,'Two-factor authentication helps protect an account by...','["turning off security", "removing passwords", "requiring a second proof of identity", "sharing codes publicly"]'::jsonb,2,'A second step stops many attacks.','original'),
('126.18.c.10.A',3,'A strong way to protect yourself from phishing is to...','["reply with your password", "click every link", "open all attachments", "avoid clicking links in unexpected messages"]'::jsonb,3,'Be cautious with unknown links.','original'),
('126.18.c.10.B',3,'A negative impact of cyberbullying on a victim can be...','["anxiety, isolation and trouble at school", "greater confidence", "more friends", "better grades"]'::jsonb,0,'Cyberbullying harms mental health.','original'),
('126.18.c.10.B',3,'People who bully online may face...','["awards", "school discipline and legal consequences", "scholarships", "no effects"]'::jsonb,1,'Bullies can face real penalties.','original'),
('126.18.c.11',3,'Choosing between a spreadsheet and a presentation tool depends on...','["the weather", "the file''s age", "the purpose of the project and audience", "the keyboard color"]'::jsonb,2,'Match tools to tasks.','original'),
('126.18.c.11',3,'Evaluating technology for a task involves comparing...','["nothing", "only brand names", "only color", "features, cost and ease of use"]'::jsonb,3,'Compare options before choosing.','original'),
('126.18.c.12.A',3,'Which term describes a program that lets you browse the internet?','["web browser", "motherboard", "router cable", "printer driver"]'::jsonb,0,'Browsers display web pages.','original'),
('126.18.c.12.A',3,'The term ''bandwidth'' refers to...','["file name", "how much data can be sent over a connection", "battery capacity", "screen size"]'::jsonb,1,'Bandwidth measures data capacity.','original'),
('126.18.c.12.B',3,'A strong file naming convention includes...','["just ''file''", "spaces only", "date, project name and version", "random letters"]'::jsonb,2,'Consistent names keep files organized.','original'),
('126.18.c.12.B',3,'Backing up important files in two places protects against...','["slow typing", "small screens", "bad lighting", "data loss"]'::jsonb,3,'Backups prevent loss.','original'),
('126.18.c.12.C',3,'To edit a photo, a student should choose...','["image editing software", "a spreadsheet", "a calculator", "a command prompt"]'::jsonb,0,'Match software to the task.','original'),
('126.18.c.12.C',3,'A tool that is best for creating an animation is...','["a typing tutor", "animation or video software", "a file compressor", "a clock app"]'::jsonb,1,'Animation requires specific tools.','original'),
('126.18.c.12.D',3,'To improve typing speed, a student should...','["look at the keys always", "avoid practice", "practice regularly using proper finger placement", "type with two fingers"]'::jsonb,2,'Proper technique builds speed.','original'),
('126.18.c.12.D',3,'WPM stands for...','["web page menu", "write print mail", "window pane mode", "words per minute"]'::jsonb,3,'WPM measures typing speed.','original'),
('126.18.c.12.E',3,'The shortcut Ctrl+V (or Command+V) will...','["paste copied content", "save a file", "print the page", "close a window"]'::jsonb,0,'V pastes.','original'),
('126.18.c.12.E',3,'The shortcut Ctrl+S (or Command+S) usually...','["undoes typing", "saves your work", "opens a file", "prints the page"]'::jsonb,1,'S saves.','original'),
('126.18.c.12.F',3,'If a printer does not respond, a first troubleshooting step is to...','["ignore it", "uninstall the OS", "check that it is powered on and connected", "smash it"]'::jsonb,2,'Check the basics first.','original'),
('126.18.c.12.F',3,'Testing potential solutions to a software problem means...','["giving up", "changing everything at once", "guessing", "trying one fix at a time and observing results"]'::jsonb,3,'One change at a time isolates the cause.','original'),
('126.18.c.12.G',3,'Sharing a file with a group through the cloud is useful because...','["everyone can access the latest version", "it is lost on shutdown", "it cannot be edited", "only one person can open it"]'::jsonb,0,'Cloud sharing keeps files current.','original'),
('126.18.c.12.G',3,'A flash drive is an example of...','["cloud storage", "local, portable storage", "a network", "an output device"]'::jsonb,1,'It stores data physically.','original'),
('126.18.c.12.H',3,'In a word processor, a feature that checks spelling and grammar is the...','["print preview", "page border", "proofing or review tool", "zoom slider"]'::jsonb,2,'Review tools find errors.','original'),
('126.18.c.12.H',3,'In a spreadsheet, the tool that calculates averages is...','["a cursor", "a font", "a slide", "a function"]'::jsonb,3,'Functions perform calculations.','original')
